+  // A stale read here is exactly what a worker-is-dead and a heartbeat-store-went-quiet look
+  // like from the outside — reading a timestamp can't tell them apart. fenceIfStale is the CAS
+  // that can: it only fences (and lets us release) if `current.lease` is still the holder of
